on average; deliveries of 140–150 units on top of leftovers will overflow the 164-unit store |\n| 3 | every 2 days | ~1.20 / 1.20 | Good size; deliveries of about 128 units are getting close to capacity |\n| 4 | every 2 days | ~1.29 / 1.31 | More spoilage; deliveries of 134–139 units plus leftovers are likely to overflow |\n| 5 | daily | ~1.10 | 26 order days × 36 = 936, about 470 more than the every-two-days plans |\n| 6 | every 2 days | ~1.15 / 1.15 | Closest to the estimated best size, and safe on capacity |\n| 7 | every 2 days | 1.10 / 1.25 | Reasonable; a bit lean on product 0 |\n| 0 | every 2 days, plus an extra day-0 order | ~1.14 / 1.15 | Almost the same as 6, but with one more 36 order fee |\n\n**Ranking.** Candidate 6 is most likely best. Candidates 0 and 3 are close behind, then 7. Candidates 4, 1, 5 and 2 are unlikely to be best."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4377, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2305, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4377}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T21:32:37.095Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVMF9Zs7988crUZgrmQL"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01VgDDADHNGKh7dznFrsqYQb", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVMF9pzNiUMQC7SKuxPc", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01VgDDADHNGKh7dznFrsqYQb", "